# funr2_qos.dem — pp-playtest-fun R2, strategy 5 (delta check): QoS TRIAGE.
# Byte-clone of funr2_balanced (same mesh, same cadence) + engineered lanes
# at era-3 arrival: email -> express, streaming -> best_effort, and a manual
# 50/30/20 reserved split on the three trunk pipes. Round-1 finding was that
# this strategy was byte-identical to BALANCED (lanes not load-bearing,
# issue #121). R2 question: with era 3 survivable, do lanes move ANYTHING
# measurable (sim hashes, outcome, surge latency)?
seed 2026
run 152000ms
era 2
health on
win surge 90
box on
advance gate on
fixture off
spawn_node residential 4 10
spawn_node residential 4 22
spawn_node residential 12 8
spawn_node residential 14 24
spawn_node residential 18 8
spawn_node residential 20 24
spawn_node residential 26 8
spawn_node residential 30 24
spawn_node small_biz 36 20
spawn_node content_host 36 26
spawn_node router_basic 8 16
spawn_node router_basic 16 16
spawn_node router_basic 24 16
spawn_node router_basic 32 16
at 2000ms draw 0 10 standard
at 2000ms draw 1 10 standard
at 2000ms draw 2 10 standard
at 2000ms draw 10 11 standard
at 10000ms draw 3 11 standard
at 10000ms draw 4 11 standard
at 10000ms draw 11 12 standard
at 18000ms draw 5 12 standard
at 18000ms draw 6 12 standard
at 18000ms draw 12 13 standard
at 18000ms draw 7 13 standard
at 18000ms draw 8 13 standard
at 18000ms draw 9 13 standard
at 31000ms modernize 3 wide
at 31000ms modernize 6 wide
at 31000ms modernize 9 wide
at 32500ms modernize 4 wide
at 34000ms modernize 5 wide
at 35500ms modernize 0 wide
at 37000ms modernize 1 wide
at 38500ms modernize 2 wide
at 40000ms modernize 7 wide
at 41500ms modernize 8 wide
at 43000ms modernize 10 wide
at 44500ms modernize 11 wide
at 46000ms modernize 12 wide
# the triage layer (trunk pipes 3=10-11, 6=11-12, 9=12-13)
at 31500ms lane 3 email express
at 31500ms lane 3 streaming best_effort
at 31500ms lane 6 email express
at 31500ms lane 6 streaming best_effort
at 31500ms lane 9 email express
at 31500ms lane 9 streaming best_effort
at 31500ms weights 3 50 30 20
at 31500ms weights 6 50 30 20
at 31500ms weights 9 50 30 20
expect hash stable
